<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>댕댕이의 미니게임 천국</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Jua', sans-serif; }
        .progress-bar { transition: width 0.1s linear; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-amber-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-between p-4 selection:bg-amber-200">

    <header class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-4 text-center border-2 border-amber-200">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
            <span id="level-display" class="text-2xl text-amber-600 font-bold">LV. 1 댕댕이 초보</span>
            <span id="stage-display" class="text-lg bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-amber-800">1단계 / 3단계</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 h-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-slate-300">
            <div id="level-progress" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-500 h-full w-0 transition-all duration-300"></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full max-w-md flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center my-6">
        
        <div id="lvl2-alert" class="hidden w-full bg-orange-100 border-2 border-orange-400 text-orange-700 p-3 rounded-xl text-center mb-4 animate-bounce">
            🎉 축하합니다! 2레벨이 되어 <b>🔮 캡슐 뽑기 창</b>이 열렸습니다!
        </div>

        <div id="tab-container" class="hidden w-full flex gap-2 mb-4">
            <button id="tab-game" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-white shadow-md text-lg">🎮 게임 플레이</button>
            <button id="tab-gacha" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 shadow-md text-lg">🔮 캡슐 뽑기</button>
        </div>

        <div id="game-panel" class="w-full bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl border-4 border-amber-300 p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-between min-h-[380px]">
            <div id="game-content" class="w-full flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
                </div>
            <div id="game-controls" class="w-full mt-4 flex gap-4 justify-center">
                </div>
        </div>

        <div id="gacha-panel" class="hidden w-full bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl border-4 border-purple-300 p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[380px]">
            <h3 class="text-2xl text-purple-700 mb-2 font-bold">🔮 신비한 댕댕이 캡슐</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6 text-center">"뽑기" 버튼을 <b>꾹~ 누르고 있으면</b><br>캡슐이 열리며 선물이 튀어나옵니다!</p>
            
            <div class="w-48 bg-slate-100 h-5 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-purple-200 mb-4 relative">
                <div id="gacha-progress" class="progress-bar bg-purple-500 h-full w-0"></div>
            </div>

